	// QuantityForShippingEstimate This query parameter sets the item quantity to be used when calculating the shipping estimate information returned in the <a href="/api-docs/buy/browse/resources/item/methods/getItemByLegacyId#response.shippingOptions">shippingOptions</a> container of the response.<br><br>This value must be a positive integer value and should not exceed the quantity available in the listing. This field is not recommended for auction listings, as they will always have a quantity of 1.
